# spec: canon-kit/SPEC.md §check-amendment-retired-spelling — every amendment carries a mandatory `## Retired spellings` block, and each spelling it declares survives only at a path its `## Existing sections updated` roster names, so a roster short by a surface reds at the gate rather than being found by a grep nobody is obliged to run
